  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyuan:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAADA">微</persName>兄<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyuan:p001:m0002" ref="p93_tgr_t8r">遠</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyuan:p001:m0004" ref="p93_tgr_t8r">景舒</persName>，位光祿勳。時人謂<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyuan:p001:m0015" ref="p93_tgr_t8r">遠</persName>如屏風，屈曲從俗，能蔽風露。言能不乖物理也。</p>
